        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "bce0d1975ed4eafda1dc82a6528da5a9fbe8065583f3291d92ef05c74a9990f8",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-30",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14133.txt",
        "text_sha256": "ab0ad635fe45deae122bb95048b55e23e744166ebec72a895283a8cd249b4f76",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. All executive departments and agencies of the Federal Government \nshall be closed on January 9, 2025, as a mark of respect for James Earl \nCarter, Jr., the thirty-ninth President of the United States."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1421,
      "char_start": 1117,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14133#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14133#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "90 FR 187, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "bce0d1975ed4eafda1dc82a6528da5a9fbe8065583f3291d92ef05c74a9990f8",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-30",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14133.txt",
        "text_sha256": "ab0ad635fe45deae122bb95048b55e23e744166ebec72a895283a8cd249b4f76",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The heads of executive departments and agencies may determine \nthat certain offices and installations of their organizations, or parts thereof, \nmust remain open and that certain employees must report for duty on \nJanuary 9, 2025, for reasons of national security, defense, or other public \nneed."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1684,
      "char_start": 1423,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14133#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14133#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "90 FR 187, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "bce0d1975ed4eafda1dc82a6528da5a9fbe8065583f3291d92ef05c74a9990f8",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-30",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14133.txt",
        "text_sha256": "ab0ad635fe45deae122bb95048b55e23e744166ebec72a895283a8cd249b4f76",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. January 9, 2025, shall be considered as falling within the scope \nof Executive Order 11582 of February 11, 1971, and of 5 U.S.C. 5546 and \n6103(b) and other similar statutes insofar as they relate to the pay and \nleave of employees of the United States."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1814,
      "char_start": 1686,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14133#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14133#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "90 FR 187, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "bce0d1975ed4eafda1dc82a6528da5a9fbe8065583f3291d92ef05c74a9990f8",
        "signing_date": "2024-12-30",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14133.txt",
        "text_sha256": "ab0ad635fe45deae122bb95048b55e23e744166ebec72a895283a8cd249b4f76",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take \nsuch actions as may be necessary to implement this order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1920,
      "char_start": 1816,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14133#sec5",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 5.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14133#sec5",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "90 FR 187, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "bce0d1975ed4eafda1dc82a6528da5a9fbe8065583f3291d92ef05c74a9990f8",
