        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2548,
      "char_start": 2160,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14133#sec5-b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
