        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-03/pdf/2024-31766.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) This order shall be implemented consistent with applicable law and \nsubject to the availability of appropriations. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 16:47 Jan 02, 2025 Jkt 265001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\03JAE0.SGM 03JAE0lotter on DSK11XQN23PROD with FR_PREZDOC1\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n188 Federal Register / Vol. 90, No. 2 / Friday, January 3, 2025 / Presidential Documents"
    },
